# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layer 2: four aerotroopers (u0545 u053d u0539 u0537, inactive until
# Activate). They fight the god-mode player; then each dies a different way: charged shots,
# a missile at low health, a power bomb, the annihilator beam.
@f300 layer 2
@f560 god 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give powerBombs 5
@f580 send u0545 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate; send u0537 Activate
@f600 tp 355 -265 4
@f610 face 0
@f900 obj u0545; obj u053d
@f1200 shoot u0545; shoot u053d
@f1260 shoot u0539 missile
@f1500 obj u0545; obj u053d; obj u0539; obj u0537
@f1800 shoot u0545 charged
@f1830 shoot u0545 charged
@f1860 shoot u0545 charged
@f1900 shoot u0545 charged
@f2000 obj u0545
@f2100 damage u053d 85
@f2120 shoot u053d missile
@f2300 obj u053d
@f2400 damage u0539 80 0 powerbomb
@f2420 damage u0539 30 0 powerbomb
@f2600 obj u0539
@f2700 beam annihilator
@f2720 shoot u0537 charged
@f2760 shoot u0537 charged
@f2800 damage u0537 80 0 annihilator
